{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1417659-level-4-entropy-healing","id":1417659,"title":"Level 4 Entropy healing","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-11T10:59:47-07:00","id":1417659,"title":"Level 4 Entropy healing","content":"Hello!<br /> The M20 book says that level 4 Entropy can be used to cause or heal aggravated damage. Is it in addition to other Speheres like Life, Spirit or Matter, or can it cause/heal that damage by itself? And could it be used to heal lethal or bashing dmage as well?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T13:38:45-07:00","id":1419080,"title":"","content":"Rule 1 of Mage: There's multiple ways to do everything with different Spheres.<br /> <br /> Basically, if you can reasonably make an explanation of how you could do something with a Sphere, the GM should let you do it. That said, you should basically be able to do it if you can explain how you're healing a person with Entropy 4.<br /> As for healing lesser damage types, I can't think of any source in WoD that didn't let you heal lesser forms of damage if it could heal aggravated damage. If the GM has issues with that, I think you need to have a discussion with them as Mage is extremely dependent on the GM letting the players do nigh free form actions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}